    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Dire / conseiller / ordonner de",
     "texto": [
      "With these verbs **de** + infinitive is used: **Thomas a conseillé à Paul de dormir** (Thomas advised Paul to sleep).",
      "Also with **ordonner** and **proposer**: **Thomas a ordonné de partir** (Thomas ordered him to leave)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Watch out",
     "texto": [
      "If you say to whom, **à** + person goes: **Thomas a conseillé à Paul de dormir.** Without a person: **Il a recommandé de rester** (he recommended staying)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
